00:42:29.820 --> 00:42:39.300
0.0952381 for a 20-day exponential moving
average. So let's say a stock closed
yesterday

00:42:39.300 --> 00:42:53.480
at $65.89 and had a 20-day SMA of 62.54.
And to get our first EMA data point, we
take the 20-day

00:42:53.480 --> 00:43:07.820
